wishly-guide-navigation\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Open navigation menu\" class=\"menu-toggle mobile-nav-toggle\" type=\"button\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><main id=\"main\"><section class=\"page-hero\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"page-heading\"><div class=\"breadcrumbs\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a><span>›</span><span>Developer</span></div><span class=\"eyebrow\">FOUNDER &amp; DEVELOPER</span><h1>Meet <em>RA Fahim.</em></h1><p>Web developer and creator building modern websites, web applications, SaaS products, e-commerce platforms and practical digital products.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"page-body author-page\"><div class=\"container author-profile-grid\"><figure class=\"author-profile-photo\"><img alt=\"RA Fahim — Web Developer and Creator, Founder of Wishly\" height=\"540\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/assets/editorial/ra-fahim-developer-wishly.webp\" width=\"540\"/><figcaption>RA Fahim · Web Developer &amp; Creator</figcaption></figure><div class=\"author-profile-copy\"><p class=\"section-kicker\">ABOUT THE CREATOR</p><h2>Building useful experiences for the web.</h2><p>RA Fahim is a web developer and creator from Bangladesh and the founder and developer behind Wishly. His work focuses on modern websites, web applications, SaaS products, e-commerce platforms and practical digital products.</p><p>He created Wishly to help people turn birthdays, proposals, anniversaries, apologies, invitations and personal messages into digital experiences they can customize and share through one link—without needing to write code.</p><p>Wishly launched on October 10. Its goal is to make personal website creation approachable while giving each creator room to make a page feel like their own.</p><div class=\"author-profile-actions\"><a class=\"premium-button\" href=\"https://wishly.bd/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Explore Wishly ↗</a><a class=\"premium-button premium-button-ghost\" href=\"https://rafahim.com/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Visit portfolio ↗</a></div><div class=\"author-social-links\"><a href=\"https://github.com/rafahimn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub ↗</a><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/rafahimn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Facebook ↗</a><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/rafahimn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Instagram ↗</a></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"section-head\"><div><p class=\"section-kicker\">FROM THE BUILDER</p><h2>Read the story behind <em>Wishly.</em></h2><p>Learn about the idea, the product and the person building it.</p></div></div><div class=\"guide-grid\"><a class=\"guide-card\" href=\"/guides/ra-fahim-developer-behind-wishly/\"><div class=\"guide-art\"><img alt=\"RA Fahim, developer and creator behind Wishly\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/editorial/ra-fahim-developer-wishly.webp\" width=\"540\"/></div><div class=\"guide-info\"><span class=\"guide-tag\">Founder story</span><h3>Meet RA Fahim: The Developer and Creator Behind Wishly</h3><p>The idea behind Wishly and the work of building a personal website maker.</p><div class=\"guide-meta\"><span>Read the profile</span><span>Read story ↗</span></div></div></a></div></div></section></main><footer class=\"site-footer hp-foot\">\n<div class=\"premium-container\">\n<div class=\"hp-foot-row footer-main-row\">\n<div class=\"hp-foot-brand\">\n<a aria-label=\"Wishly Guide home\" class=\"brand-lockup brand\" href=\"/\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"brand-mark\">✦</span><span class=\"brand-lockup-copy\"><b>Wishly</b><small>GUIDE · CREATE MOMENTS</small></span>\n</a>\n<p>Ideas, practical tutorials and clear answers for creating personal websites that make life’s special moments feel even more memorable.</p>\n<a class=\"premium-button premium-button-ghost footer-main-cta\" href=\"https://wishly.bd/\" rel=\"noopene